# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Whitelist .gitignore — everything at the repo root is ignored BY DEFAULT and
#  re-included explicitly below.
#
#  This is deliberate rather than paranoid. This working directory also holds the
#  ADManager Plus product source, its dependency jars, ~300 MB of archives and a
#  VS Code workspace file containing a live auth token. A conventional blacklist
#  would publish all of it the first time someone ran `git add -A`. With a
#  whitelist, anything new at the root is invisible to git until someone opts it
#  in on purpose.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1. Ignore everything at the root.
/*

# 2. Re-include only the tool's own two modules (and this file).
!/.gitignore
!/impact-cli/
!/impact-web/

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
target/
build/
node_modules/
dist/
*.class
*.jar
*.war

# ── Logs / runtime scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
temp/
hs_err_pid*.log

# ── Generated / local-only artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────
effective-pom
effective-pom.xml
*.iml
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store

# Vite output. `npm run build` writes the compiled SPA here and Maven runs that
# build automatically at generate-resources, so these are regenerated on every
# package — committing them is pure churn (a 769 KB sourcemap per UI change).
impact-cli/src/main/resources/static/

# ── Contains secrets — DO NOT COMMIT ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Holds a live Zoho OAuth client_id + client_secret in plaintext. Redact those
# before re-including this file.
impact-cli/docs/HowTo.md
